  Start the game in Explore mode and keep the save file.  Then you can
test out any options to see what happens.  Just be sure to #quit
instead of Save.

  You're not changing the game results.  You're not abusing Explore
mode to identify items or map the area to gain an unfair advantage.
You're just seeing exactly how the internal mechanisms work.  

  Think of it as the ultimate spoiler that always gives a right
answer, although some results will always be at the whim of the Real
Nethack God.

  You'd still have died with the potions, but then could have thought
of something else to try.  As a last resort, breaking a wand of
teleport gives about a 7% of teleporting Pestilence away.


